Package: tidyodin
Title: Tidy Output from 'odin2', 'dust2' and 'monty'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("L.", "Whittles", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "l.whittles@imperial.ac.uk")
Description: Converts the arrays produced by 'dust2' simulations and
    particle filters, and the samples produced by 'monty', into long-format
    tibbles ready for plotting with 'ggplot2'. Also runs an 'odin2' model
    over many parameter sets, returning an object with the same structure
    as a set of 'monty' samples.
